&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Abacus Insights is transforming how data and AI work for health plans. Our mission is simple: make healthcare data usable, so the people responsible for care and cost decisions can act faster, with confidence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As the AI and Data Platform for Payer Intelligence, we help health plans break down data silos to create a single, trusted data foundation. That foundation powers better decisions—so plans can improve outcomes, reduce waste, and deliver better experiences for members and providers alike. Backed by $100M from top investors, we&#39;re tackling big challenges in an industry that&#39;s ready for change. Our platform enables GenAI use cases by delivering clean, connected, and reliable healthcare data to support automation, prioritization, and decision workflows—and it&#39;s why we are leading the way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our innovation begins with people. We are bold, curious, and collaborative—because the best ideas come from working together. We embrace the thoughtful use of AI and automation to drive innovation and efficiency, and we look for individuals who are curious and adaptable—those excited to leverage emerging technologies to enhance how we work—while keeping human insight, connection, and our clients at the center of every decision.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ready to make an impact? Join us and let&#39;s build the future together.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is a contract role.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;The DevOps Team focuses on improving the telemetry around and availability of Abacus&#39; product offerings while contributing to the sustainability of engineering practice throughout the organization. As the &quot;engineers behind the engineers,&quot; we are responsible for a diverse set of tasks from across the DevOps spectrum. We work in many contexts, using many tools and technologies to remove obstacles and keep the rest of the engineering organization moving as efficiently and effectively as possible. We are a small, nimble team making an outsized impact.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your day to day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain secure, scalable, HIPAA- and HITRUST-compliant infrastructure on multiple cloud platforms (AWS and Azure)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, implement, and manage scalable, secure, and highly available cloud infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to DevOps architecture best practices and help shape our approach to CI/CD and infrastructure as code (IaC)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineering, product, and security teams to design robust infrastructure solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain CI/CD pipelines using Python-based scripts to automate testing, validation, and deployment workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage containerized environments using Docker and Kubernetes (EKS, AKS, and self-hosted)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement monitoring and observability using tools like Prometheus, Grafana, and Splunk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the design, implementation, and adoption of our custom Python- and Cloud-based deployment platform with an eye toward continuous delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote best practices both within the team and within the larger organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring to the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of development experience, including work on complex systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cloud experience, AWS preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of Linux systems administration and networking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing a CI/CD system using an industry-standard platform such as GitLab, Jenkins, or Travis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of containerization, specifically Docker and Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent command of the tools of the trade, including Bash, Python, or Terraform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of best practices as related to designing and building efficient, maintainable, testable, portable applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keen attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, both written and verbal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team-first attitude, always looking to improve yourself and those around you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s Degree in Computer Engineering or other relevant field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment as an Equal Opportunity Employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;As a mission-led technology company helping to drive better healthcare outcomes, Abacus Insights believes that the best innovation and value we can bring to our customers comes from diverse ideas, thoughts, experiences, and perspectives. Therefore, we dedicate resources to building diverse teams and providing equal employment opportunities to all applicants. Abacus prohibits discrimination and harassment regarding race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At the heart of who we are is a commitment to continuously and intentionally building an inclusive culture—one that empowers every team member across the globe to do their best work and bring their authentic selves. We carry that same commitment into our hiring process, aiming to create an interview experience where you feel comfortable and confident showcasing your strengths. If there’s anything we can do to support that—big or small—please let us know.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;AI Use in Recruitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We use AI-powered tools throughout our recruitment process. This includes Greenhouse&#39;s Real Talent Matching Technology, which helps prioritize applications based on job-related criteria, as well as additional AI tools used to support sourcing, interview preparation, and other recruiting tasks. &lt;strong&gt;We do not remove the human element—our recruiters and hiring teams review all applications and make all decisions related to candidate progression and hiring, regardless of which tools are used to support that process.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identity and Location Verification&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;To protect the integrity of our hiring process, all interviews are conducted by live video with your camera on. Virtual or blurred backgrounds and headsets are not permitted absent an approved accommodation, and you should be in a well-lit, private space where your face and surroundings are clearly visible. Candidates who advance may also be asked to complete identity and location verification, which may include verifying your identity, work history, and confirming that you are located where your application states. Applications containing knowingly false or materially misrepresented information, including identity, location, or credentials, may be disqualified, and any offer may be rescinded if a material misrepresentation is discovered at any point in the process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;I&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;f you need an accommodation for any part of the interview process, please let your recruiter know in advance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;By applying, you acknowledge that we will collect and process your personal information for recruiting purposes in accordance with applicable data protection laws, including for the verification steps described above. Please review our&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;OWA4b048287-23b9-797d-9e94-700349584c71&quot; class=&quot;OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://nam12.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fabacusinsights.com%2Fapplicant-privacy-policy%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cheidi.weinstein%40abacusinsights.com%7C7d44e83a2b7f4081beae08df23b25d49%7C0819ed188d9747bb930bec1982f9aa76%7C0%7C0%7C639268921130656820%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C4000%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=d%2BoHUdDyVi5syk0k8eO7f73azMYj8kBhPCDKTMK%2Fcvo%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;e27af475-00b4-404d-99eb-63a7d6967b53&quot;&gt;Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;for more information, including your rights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Abacus Insights is transforming how data and AI work for health plans. Our mission is simple: make healthcare data usable, so the people responsible for care and cost decisions can act faster, with confidence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As the AI and Data Platform for Payer Intelligence, we help health plans break down data silos to create a single, trusted data foundation. That foundation powers better decisions—so plans can improve outcomes, reduce waste, and deliver better experiences for members and providers alike. Backed by $100M from top investors, we&#39;re tackling big challenges in an industry that&#39;s ready for change. Our platform enables GenAI use cases by delivering clean, connected, and reliable healthcare data to support automation, prioritization, and decision workflows—and it&#39;s why we are leading the way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our innovation begins with people. We are bold, curious, and collaborative—because the best ideas come from working together. We embrace the thoughtful use of AI and automation to drive innovation and efficiency, and we look for individuals who are curious and adaptable—those excited to leverage emerging technologies to enhance how we work—while keeping human insight, connection, and our clients at the center of every decision.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ready to make an impact? Join us and let&#39;s build the future together.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director, Client Data Engineering is a pivotal leader within our TechOps / Technical Implementation organization, responsible for leading a globally distributed team of data engineering professionals. This role sits at the intersection of client delivery, technical execution, and people leadership, with a primary focus on driving successful client implementations and scaling high‑quality data engineering practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands‑on leadership role that combines technical depth with operational excellence. The director will guide feature delivery teams, partner closely with cross‑functional stakeholders, and ensure reliable execution across complex healthcare data use cases, including ETL workflows, data mapping, and clinical data integration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your day to day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Client Implementations: &lt;/strong&gt;Oversee the end‑to‑end implementation of new clients, ensuring delivery is timely, high quality, and aligned to client expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guide Data Engineering Execution: &lt;/strong&gt;Provide technical leadership across ETL, data mapping, and data integration workflows, ensuring best practices and consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimize Interoperability Workflows: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with stakeholders to refine and improve CMS Interoperability and related implementation processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage Global Teams: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate closely with offshore and distributed teams to coordinate delivery, align priorities, and maintain operational rigor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coach and Develop Talent: &lt;/strong&gt;Mentor engineers and new hires, fostering a collaborative, performance‑driven team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Operational Execution: &lt;/strong&gt;Support day‑to‑day delivery management, resource planning, and prioritization in partnership with delivery and product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set and Track Performance Metrics: &lt;/strong&gt;Establish clear success measures for the team; monitor progress and drive continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Encourage Innovation: &lt;/strong&gt;Promote thoughtful adoption of new tools, technologies, and approaches that improve scalability, quality, and efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring to the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Engineering Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Minimum 7 years of experience in data engineering roles, including client‑facing implementations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Demonstrated experience leading and mentoring technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ETL &amp;amp; Data Integration Expertise: &lt;/strong&gt;Strong hands‑on experience designing and supporting ETL workflows and complex data integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Healthcare Domain Knowledge: &lt;/strong&gt;Working knowledge of healthcare data environments and standards; experience handling clinical or claims‑related data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Programming &amp;amp; Analytics Skills: &lt;/strong&gt;Proficiency with Python and PySpark for data processing and transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced SQL: &lt;/strong&gt;Strong ability to write, optimize, and manage complex queries across large datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud &amp;amp; Data Platforms: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience working with AWS‑based architectures; familiarity with Databricks and Snowflake.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Version Control &amp;amp; Collaboration: &lt;/strong&gt;Practical experience using GitHub or GitLab for code management and collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Problem‑Solving: &lt;/strong&gt;Clear communicator with a data‑driven approach to solving complex technical and operational challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Data Science, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we would like to see, but not required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience supporting healthcare analytics, payer systems, or healthcare operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to machine learning concepts or data science workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with data visualization tools such as Tableau or Power BI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience applying DevOps or CI/CD practices in data engineering environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get in return&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Leave &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive health coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity for every employee&amp;nbsp;– share in our success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth-focused environment – your development matters here&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work arrangements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Standard hours: 9 hours/day, 5 days/week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Pune, Hybrid (3 days a week in office)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shift: Your standard working hours will be nine (9) hours per day within the Company’s standard working hours.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Specific working hours may vary based on business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment as an Equal Opportunity Employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
