&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Abacus Insights is looking for a Manager, Business and Data Analysis to lead a distributed team of Business and Data Analysts within Client Solutions. This is a hands-on people leadership role requiring prior experience as a manager with direct responsibility for leading, developing, and managing teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Manager will lead team members based in Pune as well as other delivery locations, requiring the ability to effectively manage distributed teams across locations and time zones.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will bring strong experience working with US healthcare payer data, healthcare administration systems, and complex healthcare use cases, with demonstrated exposure to areas such as HEDIS and quality measures, CMS interoperability, risk adjustment, prior authorization, claims, provider, membership and eligibility, and other payer-focused analytics or implementation use cases.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will be accountable for both people leadership and delivery excellence, ensuring the quality of requirements, data analysis, solution design, mapping, and supporting documentation critical to successful client implementations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a working-manager role. You will stay close to client delivery and technical analysis while coaching the team, managing capacity and priorities, resolving escalations, and partnering with Business Solution Managers, Solution Architects, Data Engineering, QA, Product, and Program Management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
